/-- **The cell conclusion.**  When the maximum of the ten pair
forms is attained at `b_04`,
the value of `q_A` is bounded by
sixty times the maximum. -/
theorem ellipsoidFormA_le_of_dominant (y1 y2 y3 : ℝ)
    (hne : y1 ≠ 0 ∨ y2 ≠ 0 ∨ y3 ≠ 0)
    (hdominant : maxPairForm y1 y2 y3 = pairForm04 y1 y2 y3) :
